    },
    {
      "id": "pb_attherestaurant_0_26",
      "word": "That'll be easy to check.",
      "translation": "Это будет легко проверить.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "id": "pb_attherestaurant_0_28",
      "word": "I wrote it down on a napkin.",
      "translation": "Я записал это на салфетке.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "id": "pb_attherestaurant_0_29",
      "word": "There's only one way to check.",
      "translation": "Есть только один способ проверить.",
