    },
    {
      "id": "pb_attherestaurant_1_20",
      "word": "How long have you been a vegetarian?",
      "translation": "Давно ты вегетарианец?",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "id": "pb_attherestaurant_1_21",
      "word": "I gave up eating dessert.",
